      "comment": "Race has been decimated by scratchings. THE QUIET IMMORTAL (3) is close to a win after a string of minor placings, the latest when third over 1600m at Sandown-Hillside when he was in the firing line all the way. Comes back a notch or two here and rates highly in this small field. MEKA VIBE (2) comes back in trip having run a sound second just 2 lengths from the winner over 2050m at this track last time out and is in the mix. STAR ROYAL (9) is third-up from a spell. She has been easily accounted for at each of her four career outings but won't get a better chance to feature. SUPREME LASS (10) improved on the debut performance last time out when seventh over 1300m at Wangaratta.",
